Package: cch
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, coreutils, perl, curl, fzf (>= 0.38), jq, ripgrep
Suggests: trash-cli
Description: browse, search and resume Claude Code conversations across projects
 cch lists the Claude Code conversations of every project in one fzf list,
 with AI summaries, cost and context size, and resumes the one you pick in
 the directory where it started.
 .
 It needs Claude Code (the claude command), which is not packaged here.
 With an fzf older than 0.58, ctrl-t (switching the filter field) is not
 available; everything else works.
